      "url": "https://www.wiley.com/en-nl",
      "title": "Trusted Research & AI Insights | Wiley",
      "text": "Skip to main content\nPublishing\nResearch\nLearning\nResearch Intelligence\nAbout\nInsights\nShop\nResearch depends on trusted knowledge\n\nAs AI transforms research, evidence, transparency, and expert judgment remain essential to reliable outcomes.\n\n EXPLORE THE LATEST THINKING\n EXPLORE THE LATEST THINKING\nExpanding research influence\n\nExplore how visibility and access can help research reach more people and increase its impact.\n\nThe cost of not being heard\n\nThe cost of not being heard\n\nMeasuring the reach of open access\n\nMeasuring the reach of open access\n\nTurning information into insight\n\nLearn how researchers can navigate growing volumes of scientific information with confidence.\n\nWatch the presentation\n\nWatch the presentation\n\nFind your perfect journal match\n\nUse our Journal Finder tool to search, filter, and compare 1,800+ journals. Now with AI-powered abstract match, find the best fit for your research.\n\nBrowse and compare journals\n\nBrowse and compare journals\n\nMatch my abstract\n\nMatch my abstract\n\nTogether, we collaborate across the knowledge ecosystem to drive breakthroughs.\nAccelerate your research discovery for real-world impact\n\nFuel your research with Wiley Online Library: Access 2000+ journals, 260+ reference works, and 27,000 Books.\n\nEXPLORE NOW\nEXPLORE NOW\nSupport across the research lifecycle\n\nLeverage award-winning publishing platforms to accelerate your society’s research impact — from idea to real-world outcomes.\n\nLearn more\n\nLearn more\n\nEmpowering R&D for innovation\n\nEmpower R&D teams with premium scientific content and tools to drive breakthroughs. \n\nLearn more\n\nLearn more\n\nTextbooks designed for learning\n\nGet the Wiley  textbooks you need: Access 150-day rentals, instant digital formats, and flexible options to fit your learning goals.\n\nLearn more\n\nLearn more\n\nExplore resources tailored to your needs\nPartners\nLibraries\nCorporates\nAuthors\nEducators\nLearners\n\nPARTNERS\n\nPartner to drive growth and reach your goals\n\nLeverage Wiley’s expertise and tailored business solutions to achieve your objectives.\n\nEXPLORE NOW\nEXPLORE NOW\nSocieties\n\nPublish your  journal with Wiley. Realize your journal’s full potential with our  expert guidance across publishing, marketing and sales.  \n\nLearn more\n\nLearn more\n\nRevenue Diversification\n\nDiscover  tailored strategies to boost your presence, engage audiences, and drive  growth. From advertising management and career center solutions to  licensing and reprints, we’re the growth partner you need.\n\nLearn more\n\nLearn more\n\nWorkflow solutions\n\nModernize your publishing ecosystem with our all-in-one platform, Research Exchange,  for managing pre-prints, submissions, screening and peer review. \n\nLearn more\n\nLearn more\n\nFind learning and career resources to power your success\n\nShop textbooks, learning tools, and career resources to support your growth and development.\n\nProfessional and career development books\n\nGrow your skills and advance your career with trusted titles from expert authors. \n\nLearn more\n\nLearn more\n\nTextbooks for every student\n\nAccess affordable print and digital textbooks tailored to your learning needs. Rent or buy instantly with flexible options.\n\nLearn more\n\nLearn more\n\nSelf-paced courses for career growth\n\nAdvance your career and increase your earning potential with self-paced courses. \n\nLearn more\n\nLearn more\n\nJoin Wiley \n\nAt Wiley, brilliant minds power infinite possibilities. For more than 200 years, our people have transformed knowledge into discoveries that shape the world — and today, they’re driving what’s next in science, education, and publishing. Join a team of innovators, creators, and experts whose impact reaches everywhere. With flexible benefits, a culture of curiosity and collaboration, and limitless opportunities to grow, your talent can achieve breakthroughs that matter. Explore careers and opportunities to make a lasting impact.\n\nJOIN WILEY\nJOIN WILEY\n\nABOUT WILEY\n\nTransforming knowledge into real-world impact\n\nAt Wiley, we transform knowledge into actionable intelligence, accelerating scientific breakthroughs, supporting learning, education, and research, and driving innovation that advances fields and improves lives. Access trusted research, datasets, and AI-powered platforms designed for scientists, educators, and innovators. Partner with us to harness expertise, accelerate discovery, and make measurable impact in a rapidly evolving world.\n\nLEARN ABOUT US\nLEARN ABOUT US\nTOP\nFooter\n\n© 2000-2026 by John Wiley & Sons, Inc., or related companies. All rights reserved, including rights for text and data mining and training of artificial intelligence technologies or similar technologies.\n\nHELP\nCONTACT US\nSITEMAP\nCOPYRIGHT\nRIGHTS & PERMISSIONS\nPRIVACY POLICY\nTERMS OF USE\nHome",
